WEBVTT

00:04:28.634 --> 00:04:33.218
at the altar of so-called honor.

00:04:33.218 --> 00:04:34.752
And there is one more norm

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:37.110
of the patriarchal societies

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:41.560
that is called obedience.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:45.346
A good girl is supposed to be

00:04:45.346 --> 00:04:50.594
very quiet, very humble

00:04:50.594 --> 00:04:54.565
and very submissive.

00:04:54.565 --> 00:04:55.904
It is the criteria.

00:04:55.904 --> 00:04:59.736
The role model good girl should be very quiet.

00:04:59.736 --> 00:05:02.025
She is supposed to be silent